  "body": "Some homes simply make everyday life feel easier. With inviting spaces to come together, quiet corners to unwind and a layout that gives everyone room to breathe, this contemporary Ara Hills residence has been thoughtfully designed around the way families live. Occupying a 363sqm (approx.) section with approximately 204sqm of floor area, the home features four bedrooms, three bathrooms, two living areas and a double internal-access garage, bringing comfort and versatility together across two beautifully arranged levels.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you enter, the sense of space and considered design is immediately apparent. The kitchen makes a striking impression with its sophisticated dark cabinetry, quality Bosch appliances, including a built-in microwave and oven, and a generous island bench, creating a stylish setting for everything from quick weekday breakfasts to leisurely weekend cooking. Flowing naturally into the dining and living areas, this welcoming space is filled with natural light, while sliding doors invite you outside to the deck and backyard. It's an effortless extension of the home, perfect for summer gatherings, outdoor dining or simply enjoying a little fresh air.\r\n\r\nA thoughtfully positioned bedroom on the ground floor adds another dimension to the home's appeal. With convenient access to a semi-ensuite bathroom, it provides a comfortable option for guests, extended family or anyone who appreciates having their own space without heading upstairs. The double internal-access garage, complete with pre-wiring for an EV charger, adds a practical touch for modern living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs brings a different atmosphere, offering a wonderful balance between relaxation and privacy. A second living area creates a comfortable place to escape the bustle downstairs, whether for a favourite movie, a quiet evening or a little extra family space. The master suite offers its own sense of retreat, complete with an ensuite featuring a double vanity and bathtub. Two additional bedrooms and a well-appointed family bathroom provide comfortable accommodation for the rest of the household.\r\n\r\nBeyond the front door, Ara Hills offers a lifestyle that combines neighbourhood charm with everyday convenience. Enjoy nearby walking paths and green spaces, spend weekends exploring Orewa Beach, or make the most of the local cafés, shops and amenities. With easy access to the motorway, travelling further afield is equally convenient.\r\n\r\nModern without feeling overwhelming, spacious without sacrificing warmth, and flexible enough to grow with your needs, 64 Huanui Drive is a place where the little moments of everyday life can become something special.\r\n\r\nCome along and see how naturally this home could fit into your next chapter.",
